00:37:30.000 --> 00:38:11.000
it's really important to maintain that connection and to try to do things with your spouse to try to keep that connection going because the strength of those two parent families comes from the strength of their relationship. and the importance of social networks. You know, if you're finding that you and your partner don't do a lot with friends together, I would suggest that they look at that and see if there are ways that they can branch out a bit, maybe have some work colleagues and their spouses over to your place or neighbors because they can be so enriching for our relationships.
保持这种联系非常重要，并尝试和你的配偶一起做事情，以保持这种联系的持续，因为这两个父母家庭的力量来自于他们关系的强度。以及社会网络的重要性。你知道，如果你发现你和你的伴侣不经常和朋友一起做事情，我建议他们看看这一点，看看是否有办法稍微扩展一下，也许可以请一些同事和他们的配偶到你家里来或者邻居，因为他们对我们的关系非常有益。

